  </item>
  <item>
    <title>神性在节拍里崩塌 vol.9</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68333c13dce640bfddc286c8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68333c13dce640bfddc286c8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 May 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>Intro</span></h2><span></span><p><span>女神的名字，不仅是神话书页上的符号，更是音乐人手中的棱镜——折射出人类对爱情、权力、自然与永恒的永恒追问。她们的故事，早已刻进我们的DNA：盖亚的母性创世、芙蕾雅的战争与柔情、维纳斯的完美枷锁、珀耳塞福涅的宿命轮回、阿佛洛狄忒的欲望双刃……每一首以她们命名的歌曲，都是一次现代人与远古神的灵魂共振。接下来，请戴上耳机——让我们潜入旋律的深海，打捞神话的碎片</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：罗成、'Elva'</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 碎片一：自然母性、秩序与混沌 - </span><em><span>盖亚 Gaia</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 碎片二：女性力量、生死循环 - </span><em><span>芙烈亚 Freyja</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> 碎片三：理想化女性美、爱情、婚姻 - </span><em><span>维纳斯 Venus</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1147">19:07</a> 碎片四：自然循环、被动命运、生死两面 - </span><em><span>珀耳塞福涅 Persephone</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> 碎片五：爱情的双面性、艺术美 - </span><em><span>阿佛洛狄忒 Aphrodite</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2008">33:28</a> 神的审判</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>Topic</span></h2><span></span><p><span>跪下、拜拜！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6540a935eb600bb7a5f2076a/llOZ-hRQUu_8xAQ375h4val1Fxqp.m4a" length="36320630" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsucaMJkzp23xxALBOVDnTjMt5s3.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>有病的歌之健康大讲堂 vol.8</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67952bf9d74435e4a3c3b276</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67952bf9d74435e4a3c3b276</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Feb 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>Intro</span></h2><span></span><p><span>时隔这么久，归来就是如此沉重/严肃的话题，但这也是本节目一贯的作风——“很敢”。病症/病痛，一直以来都是人们尽量避而不谈的话题，仅次于死亡。但今天带来的这些曲目，跟本节目一样“很敢”，把病症/病痛当作曲名，用一种强烈的隐喻表达情绪。今天，罗成和Terrance就cos一下医师，深度剖析这些典型案例，给大家带来乐坛健康大讲堂。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：罗成、Terrance [</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/654c68245ae1d66b7444cb7e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/654c68245ae1d66b7444cb7e"><span>别叫FM</span></a><span>]</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 第一页病例，“</span><em><strong><span>劣根</span></strong></em><span>让祷告也像胡闹” 狂恋的定义不过如此</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 第二页病例，“睡得越安稳，越</span><em><strong><span>恐慌</span></strong></em><span>”唱什么情歌？谈什么信仰？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 第三页病例，也许你就是会在下个春天自愈的</span><em><strong><span>花粉症</span></strong></em><span>，但又会一粒粒侵入我</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a> 第四页病例，你再不出现，我的</span><em><strong><span>夜盲症</span></strong></em><span>就要成为永恒</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2607">43:27</a> 第五页病例，上帝会随机挑选可人儿患上这种</span><em><strong><span>幸福的残忍</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3182">53:02</a> 第六页病例，醉乡路稳宜频到，此外不堪行。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3567">59:27</a> 健康大讲堂结语</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>Topic</span></h2><span></span><p><span>你目前最严重的病是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目原定于2025.2.8发行，但不幸大S离开了我们，故延期至2025.2.28 RIP</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6540a935eb600bb7a5f2076a/lnfG6Iu2OOhxHesVBFbD9PkyDGyF.m4a" length="63946828" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtvvnvIAfEOtx1EC8KzT6aWzTvXC.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>记得把这些歌装进行李箱 vol.7</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662b73328a089719b7fa3134</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662b73328a089719b7fa3134</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Apr 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>Intro</span></h2><span></span><p><span>临近五一假期，你要去哪里？正如我们在第四期中提到的，一份“刚好”的旅行歌单会给旅途增添不少精彩氛围和情绪。所以在我眼中，旅行歌单甚至成为了行李的一部分，相比梳洗衣物等，我会花费更多的时间整理歌单。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们刻意地制作很长 包含了11首歌，只是为了能在你的旅途车程中在你的耳机里陪你一段，或许有了这些歌 你眼中的风景将不再是那张无声的图片。现在我们就一起搭上这趟郊游巴士，聆听沿途风景吧！（附：许美静事件亲历者传达真相）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播 - 罗成，ander，迦南</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">00:04:52</a> 早上好！梁静茹叫你起床啦～ </span><em><span>《你还在不在》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="548">00:09:08</a> 行李收拾好了吗？微风拂面时陈绮贞说</span><em><span>《让我想一想》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">00:13:00</a> 我们要去哪？和侯湘婷约好</span><em><span>《一起去巴黎》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">00:19:00</a> 无聊车程中的“八卦”真相，我们见许美静一面</span><em><span>《今天的太阳》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1729">00:28:49</a> 太阳过后沐浴万芳的</span><em><span>《太阳雨》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">00:37:37</a> 郑宜农拖着行李箱，细数沿途</span><em><span>《千千万万》</span></em><span>的风景</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2605">00:43:25</a> 刘柏辛祝你平安并附上一首</span><em><span>《香缇颂》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2824">00:47:04</a> 我们的列车停靠在</span><em><span>《台北车站》</span></em><span>飞石号</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3064">00:51:04</a> 下车到家后，听李心洁的</span><em><span>《夜游》</span></em><span>冲个热水澡吧！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">00:56:20</a> 梦中我们回到雷光夏的</span><em><span>《故乡》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3620">01:00:20</a> “上升价值”+“心灵鸡汤”成为合格的</span><em><span>《乘客》</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>Topic</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大家五一去哪里？会带着哪些歌？我们下期再见，干杯🍻</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lh75TD74FNOe8Td9L07c2avWosaA.m4a" length="64492700" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FthgVGG95vbtKTokwtF83iGOSntj.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>淡淡的、典典的2023年终歌单 vol.6</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65efc7608e6f71a5b772c148</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65efc7608e6f71a5b772c148</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Mar 2024 03:09:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>转眼间，2023年从你我的手中溜走，一直认为毕业后的生活是我开始掌控我自己生活的开始，但事与愿违，好像什么事情都无法掌控、什么事情都不是自己所想的那样，2023年可能是我最开心的一年同时也是令我最折磨的一年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>矫情过后，这期节目辗转反侧终于淡淡地和大家见面了！本期节目分为年度单曲和年度专辑两个部分，另外《三两懂听》嘉宾团每位还为大家精心挑选了各自的年度单曲，干货满满的一期节目一起来听！喜欢就要</span><em><strong><span>订阅订阅订阅</span></strong></em><span>呀！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主持：罗成，Ander</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Singles</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> 宝贝，为什么闷闷不乐？</span><em><span>sulky baby - yeule</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a> 不会再难过所有离开；不再指责 无果的爱。</span><em><span>烟花 - 窦靖童</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a> Shining the world all over me. </span><em><span>Butterfly Net- Caroline Polachek</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> You know I got nothing under this overcoat. </span><em><span>Let the light in - Lana Del Rey</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a> 舒肤佳渴望被暴烈的爱着。</span><em><span>Will anybody ever Love me? - Sufjan Stevens</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">19:57</a> Look over the edge but not too far. </span><em><span>I Believe - Caroline Polachek</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> That's how the light shines in. </span><em><span>Kintsugi - Lana Del Rey</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1813">30:13</a> 记忆中的盛夏，也许有点偏差，让我一人 回去吧。</span><em><span>** - ***</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1851">30:51</a> 从一个斑点开始扩散，一直溃烂到体无完肤。</span><em><span>体无完肤 - 裘德</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2173">36:13</a> 一种觉醒瞬间的失落，粉粉的。</span><em><span>what was i made for- Billie Eilish</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>Albums</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">40:20</a> 一张足够私人化的专辑，一张从家族 亲情 死亡 爱情 友情入手的专辑，谱出一首首"挽歌"。</span><em><span>Did you know that there's a tunnel under ocean blvd - Lana Del Rey</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a> 每首歌都赋格了另一特殊意义，只在情人节发行的专辑。</span><em><span>Desire, I want to turn into you - Caroline Polachek</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2852">47:32</a> 当这杆标枪没扎在我身上的时候我怎么会将它投向你。</span><em><span>Javelin - Sufjan Stevens</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3054">50:54</a> 听的yue了姐用着黑嗓的唱腔唱着这些隐隐作痛的歌词的时候我们就该意识到这次是“玩真的！” S</span><em><span>oftscars - yeule</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3268">54:28</a> 米斯基滑铁卢？现在回来等你爱自己。</span><em><span>the land is inhospitable and so are we - mitski</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3475">57:55</a> 只有“没上过班的人”才能写出这么快乐的歌。</span><em><span>春游 - 窦靖童</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3641">1:00:41</a> 首单是在干什么？这个角度来听才对。</span><em><span>Flow - 杨乃文</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3831">1:03:51</a> 祝你不遗忘，甚至比之前还要记得更清楚。</span><em><span>盆地 - 郑兴</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3983">1:06:23</a> 这张同名专辑，玩的就是一个“概念专辑”的概念。</span><em><span>裘德 - 裘德</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4237">1:10:37</a> 语言、世界、土地，她用母语唱着爱。</span><em><span>迁徒 - 叶颖</span></em></p><span></span><h2><span>✨嘉宾团精选 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4426">1:13:46</a></span></h2><span></span><p><span>小穆：Lovesong - The Cure</span></p><span></span><p><span>迦南：自恋影院 - 卢巧音</span></p><span></span><p><span>小徐：一样会潇洒 - 张蔷</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>讨论</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你的2023年度好歌有哪些？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ln9nCCstKN7it5HoTto3UvEzoiIw.m4a" length="81168645" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:22:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZuSVVLTDZ1cHo1UTF3anNGcTQxUzhHLUswQTUucG5n.png"/>
