  <item>
    <title>对于告别我总是显得粗鲁 vol.5</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6590e9d720d779b49d226523</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6590e9d720d779b49d226523</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Dec 2023 04:11:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>Intro</span></h2><span></span><p><span>只因人都在风中，聚散不由人。在2023年的最后一天，我们来听听告别。无论或大或小，对人或对事物，当下或未来，我们都会面临告别的“小剧场”，上演一场内心戏。而当下的你是否会像小徐一样不知如何把告别显得不粗鲁，或像罗成一样简单地说一句“拜拜”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>年终最后一期，给大家准备了很多故事和猛料，所以有点儿长 XD</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播 - 罗成，小徐</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">00:04:08</a> 那些下午我决定要走，只能留给你《雨水一盒》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">00:14:32</a> 毕业季的粗鲁告别（小徐哭+1）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">00:18:55</a> 《再一次的再见》后，下次相见就是难得一见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">00:27:09</a> 看电视节目里的告别（小徐哭+2）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1699">00:28:19</a> 大人们告别后，都会反思是自己太《贪心》吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">00:35:48</a> 乌鸦与猪的分手（小徐哭-1）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">00:42:10</a> 《you don't have to》let her go</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3081">00:51:21</a> 天下还有《不散的筵席》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3483">00:58:03</a> 那些好时光，对我来说太深刻，无比珍贵以至于越想越觉得难过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3758">00:62:38</a> 告别时在《离别的车站》对你呼喊“记得看情深深雨濛濛～”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4298">00:71:38</a> 新专推荐《裘德》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4378">00:72:58</a> </span><em><span>2023，拜拜</span></em></p><span></span><h2><span>Topic</span></h2><span></span><p><span>你最近一次有“感觉”的告别是什么场景？当时耳畔的BGM是什么？我们下期再见，干杯🍻</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群入群方式见节目公告🪧</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lm_ThsZ0Re5Cp0RVMwn2i6rFGXEx.m4a" length="80347540" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:22:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsea1tXUE6yu64KLb7H4PUleE9_P.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>那么就要去远方 vol.4</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657dbcd33d5d24e9cb3e8fe7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657dbcd33d5d24e9cb3e8fe7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 16 Dec 2023 15:05:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>Intro</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>临近元旦短假以及春节假期，身边的J人都已经开始计划节日的</span><a href="https://c6.y.qq.com/base/fcgi-bin/u?__=kfVqL8VBQccO" data-url="https://c6.y.qq.com/base/fcgi-bin/u?__=kfVqL8VBQccO"><span>旅行</span></a><span>安排。与此同时，老朋友迦南也即将启程踏上东南亚环游的旅途。不确定是否是独行还是结伴，但无论是哪一种选择，相信大家也一样总会有一个人享受耳机世界的时刻。而这些歌曲会比照片更抽象生动，将途中的风景事物具化到旋律里，留作纪念。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们真的会为每一段旅程创建一个专属歌单，边走边听，一直走到未来的某个片刻，当耳机想起那时的歌曲，我就相信我还是在旅途中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播 - 罗成，迦南</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">00:05:50</a> 梦幻南风带祁紫檀和我们迷失在柬埔寨</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">00:14:09</a> 你在东京餐馆会和waiter搭话嘛？艾敬来教你</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1443">00:24:03</a> 处黄昏的洱海上，徐佳莹撑着船帆</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2007">00:33:27</a> 除了陈绮贞，关淑怡也有旅行的意义 在地尽头</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">00:41:30</a> 归途后的空虚惆怅由郁可唯唱给你听</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3234">00:53:54</a> "如果祸与福都躲不过，就每天当没明天捉紧爱人过"</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3741">01:02:21</a> 回不去的"2018"平静美好的日子好像已经变成一种奢望</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>Topic</span></h2><span></span><p><span>那么就要去远方了，你的下一站是哪里？会带着哪些歌？我们下期再见，干杯🍻</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhx_T1cxlznjyYcG3iTZ3MSr8NCp.m4a" length="69258059" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:11:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvvftuyIDwqEugMTexrQuSRZlfUF.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>对此，往往遗憾大于向往 vol.3</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/655a08b1c9e7cfe025d38021</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">655a08b1c9e7cfe025d38021</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Nov 2023 13:08:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Intro</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>面对向往的两种极端，我们往往都选择折中的解决方案，而正是因为这种“妥协”我们把自己变得人不人鬼不鬼的死样子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们将追溯那些引发遗憾的音符，从极简电音到木吉他acoustic，每一首歌曲都是一个故事，带领着我们回到曾那个真切感受到疼痛的时间段。在引言部分，我不会想去陈述或让大家猜这些故事是什么，因为这些旋律和词作就已足够。现在，请拿出</span><a href="https://c6.y.qq.com/base/fcgi-bin/u?__=kfVqL8VBQccO" data-url="https://c6.y.qq.com/base/fcgi-bin/u?__=kfVqL8VBQccO"><span>一包纸巾。</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播 - 罗成，Ander</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 听听留这么多遗憾的“此”是什么？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="718">11:58</a> 数数看自己是小数点后第几位，多美的画面</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> “我有个朋友”的真实故事，一首歌一封信</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a> 你能不能？肯不肯？没事吧没事吧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2346">39:06</a> 妈呀！舔狗！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2732">45:32</a> 我却像当天的少年，但已是能控制我所有泪腺</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3159">52:39</a> 不得不承受，诚挚的期待总换来遗憾</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3573">59:33</a> 你怎么敢不接！还好你没接...</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>Others</span></h2><span></span><p><span>纸不够就留言，我递给你！我们下期再见，干杯🍻</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljSuOQrKnqXcB5l5VsKXrbRH7V6u.m4a" length="65436215" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuSFWanrdnj-wZYnUY9FraUGUWeA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>华语音乐里的X主题 vol.2</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6551e781c9e7cfe02595c659</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6551e781c9e7cfe02595c659</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Nov 2023 09:08:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Intro</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>如果终有一次结局，我们这次想带你走过一生的缩影。其实很有意思的是纵观华语乐坛，这种宏大的话题往往少有音乐作品来选材去隐喻些什么，甚至明示都难得。</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是这次，毕竟我们的远大志向是做出国内最牛的音乐播客（吹牛X），本期嘉宾小木同学搜罗了茫茫曲库，只为带你尝遍这人生的禁果（本期节目有7颗）yuh.</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播 - 罗成，Ander，小木</span></p><span></span><h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 你XX！让你听点好的你不听！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a> 跟HUSH来学习重构当下时代的“三角关系”《都会爱情三角习题》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="669">11:09</a> 情欲孤独、令人窒息的潮湿房间里听莫文蔚吟唱《浮砂》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>（missing one song due to xxxxxx)</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">19:28</a> 你没有 brain, that's too bad. 跟ciacia何欣穗一起大喊《I want my life back》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 陈珊妮教我们《捆缚》自己，然后对着镜子说："xx, xxx"</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2194">36:34</a> 终于有一首写给老年自己的流行歌《阿兹海默》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2768">46:08</a> 我会去片大海，无忧无虑去爱，留下一封《遗书》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 心灰意冷年代里一场温存的宿醉，在那《月光洒落的地方》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>Others</span></h2><span></span><p><span>禁果吃够了吧！我们下期再见，干杯🍻</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls0FWIIAD30EqY5R6cWuaDeuRGMn.m4a" length="63209111" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnPes4YXNXnggB75fQJjvzvJs55J.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>秋天（不要来）vol.1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6545dce42e4c3cf8654ccaa5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6545dce42e4c3cf8654ccaa5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 Nov 2023 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Intro</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>一阵微风、一片叶子坠地、雨滴落下或是在夏末初秋里遥远的蝉鸣，令聆听者得到自由的一瞬间，在那一瞬间，城市的钢筋水泥消失、喧嚣的事物仿佛从未发生.</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目中给大家精选的</span><strong><span>六首歌</span></strong><span>，或许是一剂冲淡这些厚重浓稠思绪的药物；也可能对于“病入膏肓”的人来说，是强化激素。但无论怎样，希望它们是连接你与秋天的通道，所以深棕也好 淡黄也罢，我们总算在秋天“结了果”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播 - 罗成，Ander</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>（首期开篇包含了部分节目介绍及由来，跳转主题内容请点击--&gt; <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> ）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 《三两懂听》是如此这样随意却有仪式感地诞生</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> 为什么这次不让秋天来？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="559">09:19</a> 跟着陈绮贞开启身心双重的秋天流浪</span><em><span>《秋天蒙太奇Live》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 侯湘婷点题</span><em><span>《秋天别来》</span></em><span>其实是为了留住这个夏天</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> 秋天也可以是微醺的极致浪漫 Sade </span><em><span>《By your Side》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1976">32:56</a> 你淋过西安秋天的“梅雨”吗？没有的话，苏打绿给你下一场</span><em><span>《下雨的夜晚》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2543">42:23</a> 透过厚厚音墙的泡泡雨 Pocari Sweet </span><em><span>《To my Love》</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2816">46:56</a> 就在这个城市里，我在秋天念着曹方的</span><em><span>《孤单的独白》</span></em><span>自言自语的期待</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3370">56:10</a> 听Ander说说他的“第一次”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>（结尾彩蛋🎉）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>Others</span></h2><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区留下 专属你的“秋天的歌”是哪一首？更期待的是你与它之间的故事。我们下期再见，干杯🍻</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvzA7dfw1HrwPdMeMgBnYJi6mCg5.m4a" length="58363584" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhuYOZTzK1iZI5I_ljixZPGFHn0L.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
